---
title: Scan Job Error Path
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as WordPress Plugin
    participant API as /recognition/analyze
    participant Queue as ScanQueueService
    participant Worker as scan_worker.py
    participant ScanSvc as ScanService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Logger as Logging

    Note over Client,DB: Legend: ENTRY = external entrypoint, Dashed arrow = optional wiring
    Note over Client,DB: Mini-map: ENTRY: POST /recognition/analyze -> ScanQueueService -> SqlAlchemyScanQueueRepository, Worker: recognition/worker/scan_worker.py, ScanSvc: recognition/application/scan/service.py

    Client->>API: ENTRY: POST /recognition/analyze
    API->>Queue: create_scan_job_record()
    Queue->>DB: INSERT identity_scan_jobs + identity_scan_job_items
    API-->>Client: 202 accepted {job_id}

    Worker->>DB: claim pending IdentityScanJobItem
    Worker->>ScanSvc: process_media_item(...)
    alt model/IO error
        ScanSvc-->>Logger: exception
        Worker->>DB: mark item failed or release for retry
        alt attempts less than max
            Worker->>DB: status=pending, attempts+1
        else attempts exhausted
            Worker->>DB: status=failed, last_error
        end
        Worker->>Queue: refresh_job_progress(job_id)
        Queue->>DB: update IdentityScanJob status (failed if any failed items)
    else success
        Worker->>DB: status=completed, identities_detected
        Worker->>Queue: refresh_job_progress(job_id)
        Queue->>DB: update IdentityScanJob status/progress
    end

    Client->>API: GET /recognition/jobs/{job_id}
    API->>Queue: get job status
    Queue->>DB: SELECT identity_scan_jobs
    API-->>Client: {status, progress, message}
